                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 64-year-old female patient, who was admitted on 08.12.2024 with confirmed Multiple myeloma. On admission, a thorough physical examination was performed, followed by laboratory workup including blood tests and bone marrow assessment to stage the disease. Imaging was obtained to evaluate for skeletal involvement. Following multidisciplinary discussion and treatment planning, the patient was initiated on systemic induction chemotherapy with an antineoplastic regimen. She tolerated the first cycle well without significant adverse events. Patient education regarding her diagnosis, treatment plan, and potential side effects was provided prior to discharge. She is discharged in stable condition and will require close outpatient follow-up including monitoring of haematological parameters. Please do not hesitate to contact our haematology department should any concerns arise.</div>
               </text>
